# Output directories (if you don't want to commit example outputs)
# You might want to commit empty placeholder directories if the script expects them
# but generally, generated output is not committed.
# Example:
# lak_edu_lb_*/
# mymada_com_*/
# google_com_*/
# (Be more specific if you want to exclude all such folders)
# Or, if you want to commit the structure but not the content:
# lak_edu_lb_*/*
# !lak_edu_lb_*/.gitkeep
# (This is more advanced, for now, just consider excluding them)

# Specific output files (if you don't commit output directories)
# *_crtsh_raw_output.json
# *_crtsh_processed_hostnames.txt
# *_ffuf_prefixes.txt
# *_final_combined_hostnames.txt
# *_gospider_all_findings.txt
# *_gau_output.txt
# *_ffuf_results.json # If you keep this temp file

